---
import CatSticker from './CatSticker.astro';
---

<div class="philosophy-container">
<section class="philosophy postcard" aria-labelledby="philosophy-heading">
    <div class="philosophy-copy">
        <h2 id="philosophy-heading">Why "Human-First Design"?</h2>
        <p>
            I love technology, but I love the humans behind it even more. Behind every great
            invention, every little avatar, everything great and small, there's a person.* And
            I never want us to forget that. So in an age where generative AI is making enough
            noise to deafen the masses, I want to champion <strong>human-first design</strong>
            &mdash; preserving the real connection between client and developer.
        </p>
        <p>
            I may use generative AI while building your site, but everything gets a human's eye
            and a human's second opinion before it ships. And if you'd rather I skip the AI
            altogether, that's more than fine &mdash; I'm just as happy building your site with
            nothing but my own two hands.
        </p>
        <p>
            I want every client to remember there's a real person behind the screen &mdash;
            someone who genuinely cares about getting your project right.
        </p>
        <p>
            Interested in working together? <a href="/contact">Reach out and let's chat.</a>
        </p>
        <p class="footnote">*For the most part &mdash; my cat helps too.</p>
    </div>

    <CatSticker rotate={-8} caption="Patchyzinha, quality control" class="philosophy-cat" />
</section>
</div>

<style>
    .philosophy-container {
        width: var(--page-content-width);
        margin: 0 0 var(--space-5) auto;
    }
    .philosophy {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: var(--space-4);
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 75%;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: var(--space-4);
    }

    .philosophy-copy {
        width: 70%;
    }

    .footnote {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
    }
</style>
